sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Ops admin
  participant UI as Ops app /payouts/[id]
  participant API as /internal/payouts
  participant PC as Paycrest or Pretium
  participant RPC as Base RPC and NEAR RPC
  participant DB as Postgres

  S->>UI: open a needs_review payout
  UI->>API: GET /payouts/:id (details, ledger, audit trail)
  opt re-fetch
    UI->>API: POST /refetch
    API->>PC: getOrder (Paycrest) or the transaction (Pretium)
    API->>DB: forward-only sync + audit payout.refetched
  end
  UI->>API: POST /resolve/prepare (paid or failed)
  alt payout waits on a NEAR Intents quote (Base hop or delivery)
    API-->>UI: refused: resolve the quote instead, at /internal/intent-quotes
  else
    API->>PC: order or transaction evidence
    API->>RPC: transfers from the transit wallet on Base, or company wallet sends on NEAR
    API->>DB: staff_confirmations row (intent hash, 5 min)
    API-->>UI: confirmation token
    S->>UI: second confirmation
    UI->>API: POST /resolve/confirm
    API->>DB: payout paid or failed, optional missing ledger debit, subject hooks, audit payout.resolved
  end
